  ('Bachelor of Industrial Engineering with Honours', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTeM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 3788, '4 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Industrial Engineering with Honours program at UTeM University Malaysia focuses on designing, improving, and integrating systems in various industries. The program aims to produce skilled graduates who are competent in industrial engineering, demonstrate leadership qualities with ethical values, and have a lifelong learning mindset. The program emphasizes problem-solving, design skills, research abilities, and the application of engineering principles. Graduates can pursue careers as Industrial Engineers, Operations Managers, and Project Managers.

