  ('Bachelor of Manufacturing Engineering Technology (Product Design) with Honours', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTeM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 3788, '4 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Manufacturing Engineering Technology (Product Design) with Honours program at UTeM University Malaysia aims to produce graduates who can apply their knowledge in Manufacturing Engineering Technology (Product Design), adapt to evolving technologies, and demonstrate professional ethics and leadership qualities. The program focuses on developing skills in problem-solving, design, experimental investigation, and the application of engineering tools. Graduates will have the ability to address engineering challenges, consider societal and environmental factors, and communicate effectively. They will also possess knowledge of project management, business practices, and entrepreneurship, and will be committed to lifelong learning and professional development.

The Bachelor of Manufacturing Engineering Technology (Product Design) program focuses on the importance of design in manufacturing. Students learn about initial design, prototyping, and final design stages. They develop skills in conceptualization, prototyping, and optimizing designs for manufacturing. Graduates are prepared to be competent and innovative product designers.

