  ('DOCTOR OF ENGINEERING', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTeM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 1982, '4 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Engineering (DEng) program at UTeM University, Malaysia, is a four-year doctoral-level program that combines academic research with industrial problem-solving and project management. This program emphasizes research relevant to industry, team leadership, and unique university-industry partnerships.

