  ('Master of Software Engineering', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTeM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 3542, '1 year', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Software Engineering (Mobile Development) at UTeM University, Malaysia, is tailored for recent graduates and industry practitioners with strong analytical and computing skills. The program aims to equip students with both fundamental and applied knowledge in mobile development, focusing on current technologies in Data Science and Analytics.

