  ('Bachelor of Computer Engineering with Honours', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'University Malaysia of Computer Science & Engineering (UNIMY)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 2625, '4 years', '["May","Jul","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Computer Engineering with Honours program at University Malaysia of Computer Science & Engineering (UNIMY) merges computer science and electronics engineering to equip students with the skills to develop new technologies. The curriculum includes topics such as electrical theory, digital circuits, programming, data structures, software engineering, computer networks, and more. Graduates will be acknowledged as Graduate Engineers (GE) and have the potential to advance their careers to become Professional Engineers with the title of Ingenieur (Ir.).

