  ('Bachelor of Computer Science (Data Science) with Honours', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'University Malaysia of Computer Science & Engineering (UNIMY)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 3938, '3 years', '["Feb","May","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Computer Science (Data Science) with Honours program at University Malaysia of Computer Science & Engineering (UNIMY) offers a comprehensive and specialized curriculum designed to equip students with the knowledge and skills required for a successful career in the field of data science. This program provides a unique opportunity for students to gain expertise in data analysis, statistical modeling, machine learning, and data visualization. By enrolling in this program, students will engage in hands-on projects, practical training, and theoretical coursework to develop a solid foundation in computer science principles and data science techniques. Graduates of the Bachelor of Computer Science (Data Science) with Honours program at UNIMY are well-prepared to pursue diverse career opportunities in various sectors, including technology companies, research institutions, financial services, healthcare, and e-commerce. They possess the skills to collect, analyze, and interpret large and complex datasets, derive actionable insights, and make data-driven decisions. With a deep understanding of data science methodologies and programming languages, graduates are equipped to contribute to the advancement of industries, drive innovation, and solve real-world problems through the power of data science.

