  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Business Management', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'University Malaysia of Computer Science & Engineering (UNIMY)' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 5478, '3 years', '["Feb","May","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) program in Business Management at University Malaysia of Computer Science & Engineering (UNIMY) offers a comprehensive and specialized curriculum for students aspiring to achieve the highest level of expertise in the field of business management. This program provides a unique opportunity for students to engage in advanced research, critical analysis, and scholarly exploration within various areas of business management. By enrolling in the program, students collaborate closely with esteemed faculty mentors, conducting independent research, contributing to the existing body of knowledge, and making significant intellectual contributions to their specialized areas of study. Through the pursuit of a PhD in Business Management at UNIMY, students develop advanced research skills, critical thinking abilities, and a profound understanding of complex business theories, strategies, and practices. Graduates of the program are well-prepared for leadership positions in academia, research institutions, industry, and government organizations, where they can drive organizational innovation, make strategic decisions, and contribute to the development of effective business management practices through their groundbreaking research, expertise, and commitment to advancing the field of business management.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., UEC, Foundation, STAM, etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

