  ('ACCA Foundation In Accountancy', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Foundation', 9623, '1 year', '["Feb","Jul","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The ACCA Foundation in Accountancy (ACCA FIA) at Sunway University is a fast-tracked program that prepares you for the ACCA Qualification, focusing on financial accounting and management accounting knowledge

