  ('Bachelor of Arts (Honours) Contemporary Music', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 7900, '3 years', '["Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'This program is designed to train versatile musicians and music producers. It combines technical and creative elements, offering a solid foundation in music theory and academic knowledge while enhancing your skills in audio technology through hands-on studio practice and interdisciplinary collaborative projects. Key subjects include composition, arrangement, sound design, film scoring, as well as music theory, history, and aural training.

