  ('Bachelor of Arts (Honours) Digital Film Production', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 7729, '3 years', '["Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Arts (Honours) in Digital Film Production delves into the creative and professional dimensions of film production, encompassing short films and documentaries, scriptwriting, sound design, acting, transmedia content creation, post-production, entrepreneurship, and internships with diverse, high-value applications.

