  ('Bachelor of Arts (Honours) Entrepreneurship', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 8329, '3 years', '["Feb","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'Do you have a groundbreaking idea? Are you ready to build a business from scratch? Success in entrepreneurship goes beyond crafting an impressive business plan and delivering a flawless pitch to investors. Entrepreneurs carve their own paths, driven by determination and ambition. At Sunway University, we offer the resources and support you need to unlock your potential and achieve your aspirations.

This degree provides comprehensive knowledge of entrepreneurship, covering areas such as business planning, financing, marketing, management, information technology, and consulting. You will delve into all facets of business and consistently engage in various entrepreneurial activities, emphasizing innovation and creative thinking. In addition to traditional business models, you will explore corporate entrepreneurship, social entrepreneurship, family business management, and the development of new ventures.

With insights from industry speakers and ample networking opportunities, you will gain a contextual understanding of the dynamic entrepreneurial landscape throughout your studies. The Sunway Innovation Labs (iLABS) will offer you a space to start building your business while you complete your degree.

Upon successful completion of the program, graduates will receive a degree from Lancaster University, along with certificates that recognize them as graduates of both Sunway University and Lancaster University.

