  ('Bachelor of Science (Honours) Financial Economics', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 7088, '3 years', '["Feb","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Science (Honours) in Financial Economics program equips graduates with essential technological skills to thrive in the evolving financial landscape, including quantitative analysis, big-data analytics, and forecasting. With its enhanced curriculum, students will learn to apply robust economic and finance theories, utilizing advanced software to transform concepts into operational models with real data, while placing a greater emphasis on technology-driven training.

