  ('Doctor of Philosophy', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3652, '3 years', '["Jan","Jul"]'::jsonb, 'A Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) is the pinnacle of academic achievement, distinguishing graduates as experts in their chosen area within business studies and positioning them at the forefront of research in their field.

Our PhD in Business offers students the chance to conduct an in-depth investigation into a chosen business specialization. They are encouraged to innovate or employ well-structured methodologies to contribute valuable theoretical and practical insights.

Students will apply the most appropriate research designs to explore or test well-informed ideas. The research results will advance the boundaries of knowledge, and students will share their scholarly findings with peers and professionals through academic networks, conferences, seminars, and publications.

Sunway University has a dedicated team of esteemed academics, including some within the top 1% and 2% of scientists worldwide, as well as authors in top-tier international business journals, to guide students throughout their research journey. Students may pursue topics directly related to their current professional role, making the PhD particularly relevant to their work, or they may choose an area they are deeply passionate about.

Our students join a community of prominent international scholars, committed to driving scientific, technological, social, and cultural advancements, shaping the boundaries of business, law, and society. Upon completing their research, our graduates will have developed a strong expertise in their field, equipped with the knowledge, skills, and personal qualities necessary to conduct independent research successfully.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Business Lecturer\nBusiness consultant\nMarket Research Analyst"]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'A Master’s degree in related fields as accepted by the University Senate

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,,Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.'),
  ('Doctor of Philosophy', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3652, '3 years', '["Jan","Jul"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy in Computing program at Sunway University is crafted to advance students'' research capabilities in critical computing fields. Candidates will be prepared to lead and innovate in computing, information, and communications technology.

Key areas of study in this program include Computer Networking, Information Systems, Human-Computer Interaction, Information Science, Image Processing, Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Data Mining, Haptics, and Software Engineering.

Through close supervision and mentorship, students will develop a comprehensive research skillset by engaging in critical literature analysis, identifying areas for meaningful contributions, synthesizing information, and presenting their findings in journals and at conferences.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,,Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

Academic and Research Positions, Industry Research Scientist,Data Scientist/Engineer,Computer Vision Engineer/AI Specialist, Human-Computer Interaction Designer', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Academic and Research Positions, Industry Research Scientist,Data Scientist/Engineer,Computer Vision Engineer/AI Specialist, Human-Computer Interaction Designer"]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'Master’s Degree in a relevant field from the University of Cyberjaya or any other institution recognised by theMalaysian government, acceptable to the University.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,,Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.'),
  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Biology', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 5478, '3 years', '["Jan","Jul"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Biology program at Sunway University is crafted to equip graduates with advanced critical thinking abilities, lifelong learning skills, and a wide range of competencies to address both national and global demands in biology. Graduates will become skilled and innovative scientists, capable of synthesizing and applying knowledge through pioneering scientific research, problem-solving, and developing creative solutions across academic and industrial research in life sciences and interdisciplinary fields.

This program provides a robust scientific foundation and advanced research skills, empowering graduates to critically analyze, apply, and integrate biological concepts. It focuses on scientific methodologies for problem-solving while emphasizing adherence to professional, ethical, and moral standards. Moreover, it nurtures effective communication skills, the ability to work independently or within multidisciplinary teams, and enhances cognitive skills—such as analysis, synthesis, and creativity—essential for high-level scientific research. Graduates will also develop leadership, entrepreneurial, and information management skills, fostering a commitment to lifelong learning.

Sunway University’s dedicated team of experienced academics offers one-on-one guidance and mentorship to support students throughout their research journey. Students are encouraged to participate in various research activities, including workshops, symposiums, and conferences organized by the university or in collaboration with other institutions. Before enrollment, candidates are advised to consult with qualified supervisors at Sunway to establish their specific research focus.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,,Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

The PhD is awarded based on the successful completion of a thesis. The thesis should demonstrate proficiency, criticality and mastery in the subject or chosen area of research.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Specialist in field"]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'A Master’s degree in biological sciences discipline or related fields that is accepted by University Senate.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,,Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.'),
