  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Hospitality and Tourism', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3652, '3 years', '["Jan","Jul"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Hospitality and Tourism at Sunway University is a research-focused program that enables students in the School of Hospitality and Service Management to explore a research topic aligned with their passions and relevant to the field. This PhD is especially valuable for students pursuing careers in hospitality, as their research can directly benefit their current or future roles and contribute to specialized knowledge within hospitality, tourism, and service industries.

The program enhances research skills through engaging seminars led by esteemed international scholars, training in research methods, and guided independent research. These components, along with collaborations with national and international partners across ASEAN and beyond, create valuable research opportunities for students.

Achieving a Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) represents the highest academic qualification and positions graduates as leaders at the forefront of their research fields.

PhD students are also encouraged to join the Asia Pacific Centre for Hospitality Research (APCHR), where they become part of an international community of respected scholars dedicated to driving progress in hospitality and tourism.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,,Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Higher Education\nAcademia\nResearch and development\nConsultancy"]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'A Master’s Degree (Level 7, MQF) or its equivalent in hospitality, tourism, or related fields as accepted by the University’s Senate.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,,Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.'),
  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Mathematical Sciences', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3652, '3 years', '["Jan","Mar","May","Jul","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'Candidates pursuing the Doctoral Degree in Mathematical Sciences will engage in high-quality and innovative research across the expansive field of mathematical sciences, emphasizing the beauty of numbers and algorithms and their practical applications in decision-making and problem-solving.

This research program is designed to enhance students'' research skills in various intriguing areas of mathematics, including pure mathematics, applied mathematics, and applied statistics. By collaborating closely with experienced supervisors, students will experience different facets of research, such as conducting thorough literature reviews, identifying areas for research contributions, and effectively communicating their findings through journal publications and conference presentations.

The program aims to equip students with robust mathematical, analytical, and statistical data analysis skills, ultimately preparing them to become proficient and well-qualified researchers.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,,Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

Candidates are required to complete three modules, namely Research Methodology, Academic Writing, and Research Proposal, in addition to the thesis component. By undergoing these modules, candidates will develop the necessary skills and knowledge to conduct research successfully towards the completion of the thesis.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Academia\nConsulting\nResearch\nIndustrial R&D"]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'Master’s Degree in a relevant field from the University of Cyberjaya or any other institution recognised by theMalaysian government, acceptable to the University.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,,Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.'),
  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Psychology', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3652, '3 years', '["Jan","Jul"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Psychology is a research-focused degree designed to provide graduates with advanced knowledge of research methodologies and the skills necessary to conduct independent research in various areas of behavioral science. Students engage in original research that pushes the boundaries of knowledge within a specialized area of psychology. Through this process, they develop the skills needed for independent research, as well as problem-solving and critical thinking abilities that can be applied in their future academic and professional pursuits.

Completing this program enables students to become experts capable of facilitating and contributing to the advancement of psychology. This qualification is essential for those aiming to pursue a career as an academic or independent researcher in the field of psychology.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g.,,Other qualifications equivalent to a Master’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

Prior to starting their thesis, students complete two taught modules: Advanced Research Methods and Advanced Statistics. These modules help students develop the necessary skills to complete their research proposal.

In consultation with their research supervisors, students identify a research problem based on findings from existing research. They then design and conduct research on the identified problem or issue using a range of scientific techniques while following the required ethical standards. They, therefore, make a unique contribution to understanding the issue under consideration or developing new solutions to address the identified problem.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Postdoctoral Research Fellow\nResearch Scientists\nAcademics - University Lecturer\nResearch Consultant\nTechnical Consultant\nTechnical Author\nSenior Analyst"]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'A Master’s degree in Psychology

