  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Sustainability Science and Technology', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3652, '3 years', '["Jan","Jul"]'::jsonb, 'This innovative PhD program is designed to develop leaders in both academia and industry through a multidisciplinary approach to sustainability. Graduates will acquire both quantitative and qualitative analytical skills essential for formulating and advocating technological solutions to global sustainability challenges.

