  ('International Preparatory Programme (IPP)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 2178, '0.6 years', '["Jan","Jun","Aug"]'::jsonb, 'The International Preparatory Programme (IPP) in Computer Science, Engineering, and Natural Sciences at Sunway University is an intensive six-month course designed for international students or candidates from specific countries wishing to enroll in certain Sunway degree programs, including those in partnership with Lancaster University.

