  ('Master in Artificial Intelligence', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 9812, '1 year', '["Jan","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master in Artificial Intelligence program at Sunway University provides a unique learning experience supported by cutting-edge facilities, impactful research, and an engaging academic community. Students have access to a dedicated AI and Machine Learning Lab, featuring high-performance GPU-powered systems, NVIDIA Jetson Nano, and IoT prototyping kits, which enhance hands-on learning through real-world applications.

