  ('Master in International Hospitality Management', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 10120, '1 year', '["Feb","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The hospitality sector is a dynamic industry that consistently adapts to fulfill the needs of global consumers. This program is designed to address the ever-changing requirements of the field. Graduates of the Master in International Hospitality Management (MIHM) will acquire valuable industry insights, interdisciplinary knowledge, diverse global management approaches, and strategic decision-making skills, effectively preparing them for leadership positions within hospitality and tourism.

