  ('Master of Business Analytics', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 10120, '1 year', '["Jan","Mar","May","Jul","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Business Analytics is an extensive and industry-focused program that integrates three vital areas: business analytics, information technology, and business innovation. This program offers the essential theoretical foundations and practical applications required for a comprehensive understanding of business analytics and related fields.

