  ('Master of Counselling', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 8022, '2 years', '["Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Counselling program at Sunway University is designed to cultivate highly competent and reflective counselling professionals capable of working in diverse settings, including educational institutions, community agencies, and workplace environments. Graduates will be well-prepared to attain professional certification as registered counsellors with the Board of Counsellors (Malaysia) – Lembaga Kaunselor Malaysia (LKM). The program combines structured coursework with supervised practical experiences, providing students with the theoretical foundation and hands-on skills necessary for effective counselling practice. This comprehensive approach ensures that graduates are equipped to meet the needs of clients across various contexts.

