  ('Master of Philosophy', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4246, '2 years', '["Jan","Mar","May","Jul","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Philosophy (MPhil) program in Business Administration is a full research degree designed to enhance students'' research knowledge and their ability to conduct independent studies in various areas of business. Students are encouraged to generate innovative ideas or apply well-considered methodologies to produce research that offers significant theoretical and practical contributions.

Participants will utilize the most appropriate research design to explore and test informed ideas. The research outcomes will advance knowledge in the field, and students will share their scholarly findings with peers and practitioners through academic and professional networks, conferences, seminars, and potential publications.

Sunway University boasts a dedicated team of academicians who mentor students throughout their research journey, allowing them to investigate a topic of their choice. Students may select a subject related to their current work, making the MPhil directly relevant to their employment, or they can choose to research any area they are passionate about. While students have the freedom to select their research topics, these topics must be contemporary, engaging, and relevant.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

