  ('Master of Science in Computer Science', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4246, '2 years', '["Jan","Feb","Mar","Apr","May","Jun","Jul","Aug","Sep","Oct","Nov","Dec"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Science in Computer Science program is designed to equip students with the skills needed to conduct research in both current and emerging fields within the Information Technology industry. Our aim is to broaden students'' intellectual horizons by fostering advanced knowledge in specialized technical areas, enabling them to lead future innovations in both industry and academia.

