  ('Master of Science in Information Systems', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4246, '2 years', '["Jan","Jul"]'::jsonb, 'Information systems are a vital component of an organization’s IT infrastructure. IT professionals who can effectively manage information resources and understand the technology and systems involved are essential to the success of modern enterprises.

This program is strategically designed to enable students to conduct information systems research that is both theoretically and methodologically sound, equipping them with the skills to plan, organize, and execute research studies at the master’s level. It deepens students'' understanding of research within their chosen area and fosters skills in effectively communicating their research findings.

