  ('Masters of Counselling', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 8837, '2 years', '["Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Counselling (Clinical Mental Health) program at Sunway University is designed to develop highly knowledgeable and skilled counseling professionals ready to address mental health issues in the community Graduates will be prepared to pursue professional certification as registered counselors with the Board of Counselors (Malaysia) – Lembaga Kaunselor Malaysia By completing the required supervised practice hours and fulfilling the Board''s requirements, they will acquire both theoretical knowledge and practical skills essential for effective counseling

