  ('Post Basic Certificate in Intensive Care Nursing', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 2723, '0.5 years', '["Mar","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Post Basic Intensive Care Nursing Course is a 6-month full-time program aimed at helping nurses enhance their knowledge, attitudes, and skills in Intensive Care nursing. Graduates of this course will be well-equipped with the knowledge and skills necessary to provide care in the critical care field, aligning with industry standards and requirements.

