  ('Postgraduate Certificate in Higher Education Practice', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Sunway University' LIMIT 1), 'Diploma', 2310, '1.3 years', '["Feb","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The program invites higher education academics who are looking to enhance their practice and gain a deeper understanding of theoretical educational frameworks, theories, and principles that apply to their work. Through engagement with and reflection on data from various perspectives—such as students, self-assessment, literature, and peers—participants embark on a journey to discover what has worked and what hasn’t in their practice, allowing them to develop strategies for improvement within their specific contexts.

