  ('Bachelor in Dental Surgery', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Management and Science University (MSU)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 25740, '5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor in Dental Surgery (BDS) program offers a comprehensive education aimed at producing skilled, compassionate, and ethical dental professionals. The curriculum combines rigorous academic coursework with extensive hands-on clinical training, providing students with a deep understanding of biological sciences, dental anatomy, pathology, pharmacology, and the latest advancements in dental technology and techniques.

