  ('Bachelor in Software Engineering with Honours UTM SPACE', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM SPACE University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4400, '4 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor in Software Engineering with Honours program at UTM University Malaysia provides a comprehensive and specialized curriculum designed to prepare students for a successful career in the field of software engineering. This program offers a unique opportunity for students to acquire in-depth knowledge and practical skills in software development, programming languages, software testing, software project management, and software quality assurance. By enrolling in this program, students will engage in hands-on projects, collaborative learning, and theoretical coursework to develop a strong foundation in software engineering principles and practices. Graduates of the Bachelor in Software Engineering with Honours program at UTM University Malaysia are well-prepared to pursue diverse career opportunities in software development companies, technology firms, research and development organizations, and IT consulting firms. They possess the skills to design and develop software solutions, analyze complex problems, and apply industry best practices in software engineering. With a deep understanding of software engineering methodologies and emerging technologies, graduates are equipped to contribute to the advancement of the software industry, drive innovation, and create impactful software solutions that meet the needs of businesses and society.

