  ('Doctor of Philosophy', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Curtin University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 11154, '4 years', '["Feb","Jul"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) program at Curtin University Malaysia focuses on uncovering new knowledge through the discovery of new facts, formulation of theories, or innovative reinterpretation of existing data. It emphasizes independent research, with at least two-thirds of the program dedicated to research activities. Candidates will work closely with a supervisor and associate supervisor(s) to develop a substantial thesis that contributes to the understanding of their field. Access to resources and financial assistance for conferences are provided to support the research journey.

