  ('Bachelor of Engineering in Cyber Security', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Xiamen University Malaysia Campus' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 6380, '4 years', '["Feb","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'As technology advances, computing systems are increasingly enabling interconnected and powerful services across nearly all aspects of life. However, the rise of new cyber threats and attacks makes it critical, yet challenging, to maintain the security of these systems, leading to a significant demand for cybersecurity professionals.

