  ('Bachelor of Science in Marine Environmental Chemistry', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Xiamen University Malaysia Campus' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 6160, '4 years', '["Feb","Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'Xiamen University (XMU) began its marine studies nearly 100 years ago and is recognized as the cradle of marine studies in China. Its Department of Oceanography, established in 1946, is the first of its kind in the country. The College of Ocean and Earth Sciences has developed into one of China’s premier marine research institutions, featuring a state key discipline in Marine Science. Among the faculty are two academicians from the Chinese Academy of Sciences and a number of experts involved in the "Thousand Talents Plan," China’s program for attracting global experts.

