  ('Bachelor of Science (Hons) in Chiropractic', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'International Medical University (IMU)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 15532, '5 years', '["Apr","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'Pursuing a career as a Chiropractor opens up a wealth of exciting opportunities in healthcare. From the outset, Chiropractic students at IMU are engaged in a primary health care profession focused on diagnosing, treating, and preventing neuromusculoskeletal disorders. You will receive training in manual techniques, emphasizing spinal adjustments as well as joint and soft tissue manipulations to address joint dysfunction and enhance rehabilitation.

