  ('Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Healthcare Management', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'International Medical University (IMU)' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 6182, '3 years', '["Jan","Feb","Mar","Apr","May","Jun","Jul","Aug","Sep","Oct","Nov","Dec"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) in Healthcare Management provides a transformative experience for exceptional students aiming to influence the industry. Through innovative applied research, IMU prepares you to excel in healthcare management, consultancy, and policy development, opening up numerous opportunities. This program allows you to embark on a significant passion project of your choice, equipping you with vital research skills for impactful contributions. Additionally, you''ll engage with a dynamic community and have the chance to present your findings to fellow researchers and global audiences, enabling you to make a meaningful mark in the rapidly evolving healthcare sector.

