  ('Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D) in Law', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Universiti Geomatika Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3520, '3 years', '["Jan","Apr"]'::jsonb, 'A PhD in law can lead to satisfying professions teaching law and doing legal research. This degree is an excellent choice for people seeking variety and the opportunity to pursue other career paths in the field of law. The candidates must create a viable''research proposal'' in accordance with the standards and structure specified by the faculty and university. The degree is conferred upon satisfactory completion of supervised research, which is assessed by a thesis and viva voce test.

