  ('Bachelor of Communication (Hons) in Media Production(UOW)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'University of Wollongong (UOW) Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 6829, '3 years', '["Feb","Apr","Jun","Sep","Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Communication (Hons) in Media Production at UOW Malaysia (Glenmarie, Selangor campus) is designed to equip students with essential knowledge, competencies, and skills necessary for success in both local and international media and communication industries. This program empowers students with technical expertise and entrepreneurial skills, making it ideal for inquisitive individuals who enjoy meeting new people and sharing experiences. The curriculum features a blend of core and specialized subjects taught by lecturers with academic and industry experience. In their final year, students complete internships at reputable media companies in Malaysia, providing valuable real-world exposure. What distinguishes this program is its focus on both theoretical and practical aspects of media production. Students have access to state-of-the-art broadcasting and media facilities and can manage the university''s Radio Station and Broadcasting Centre while participating in various media production events and competitions. Overall, this program effectively prepares graduates for successful careers in the dynamic field of media production.

