  ('Bachelor of Laws 3+0 External with (UOW)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'University of Wollongong (UOW) Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4649, '3 years', '["Jun","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Laws (LL.B) 3+0 External program offered by the University of Wollongong (UOW) in collaboration with the University of London provides a prestigious opportunity for students to pursue a law degree recognized globally. Established in 1836, the University of London is one of the UK''s oldest universities, and its LL.B program is regarded as the "gold standard" for undergraduate law degrees by legal practitioners and academics alike.

